  "content": "<h1>華麗門動畫</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gQIpdGQl/images/554da7a7dabbceadbfab61af5ecec6b454daba7d.gif\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fgQIpdGQl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/gQIpdGQl?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;labelColor=16181c&amp;color=34363c\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-door-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1357699?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;label=CurseForge&amp;labelColor=16181c&amp;color=34363c\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fP7dR8mSH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric API-必要-34363c?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=16181c\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fmOgUt4GM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Menu-可選-34363c?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=16181c\" alt=\"可選 Mod Menu\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Cloth Config-可選-34363c?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=16181c\" alt=\"可選 Cloth Config\"></a></p><p>流暢的客戶端動畫，適用於原版門與地板門。支援多人遊戲、相容材質包，並自設計相容 Sodium 和 Iris。</p><h2>功能介紹</h2><ul>\n<li>為原版門與地板門加入流暢的開關動畫</li>\n<li>可由任何來源觸發：玩家、紅石、生物或網路事件</li>\n<li>僅客戶端模組，無需安裝伺服器端</li>\n<li>尊重所有材質包與現有模型</li>\n</ul><blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ 光影提示：根據所使用的光影包，開門或關門時可能出現光照閃爍。這是光影端的限制，非本模組問題。</p>\n</blockquote><blockquote>\n  <p>ℹ️ 紋理跳動提示：你可能會在動畫結束時注意到短暫的紋理不一致。這是由於原版 Minecraft 的紋理不完全一致所致，非本模組的錯誤。可使用如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcreaky-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creaky Doors</a> 這類材質包來解決。</p>\n</blockquote><h2>開發藍圖</h2><ul>\n<li>同時開啟對開門</li>\n<li>設定選項</li>\n<li>開源</li>\n</ul>",
